ena.bob-cli-b.1/state.json","size_bytes":225}},"finished_at":"2026-07-31T08:05:27.968036","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-b.1","local_name":"bob-cli-b.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-b","agent_clan_generation":"20260731075550","approve":true,"cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-b[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Capture sub-bullets onto existing Obsidian tasks[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]`bob capture` can append a sub-bullet to an existing Obsidian task [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]via a new `@<route>^<block-id>` marker, `bob capture-tasks` lists a[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]note's open tasks with their statuses, and the Hammerspoon capture [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]panel resolves a bare `@<route>^` into a status-annotated task [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]picker.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202607/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]capture_sub_bullets.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-b[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-b/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared note-task scanner[/bold #D7AFFF]                                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]scan[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]scan: add src/native/note_tasks.rs, a pure scanner that turns one note's[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Markdown into task records (line, indentation, status, description, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]block ID, section, child span, stale-safe ref digest), plus the small [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]markdown.rs ATX-heading extraction it depends on.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Sub-bullet capture in bob capture[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]write[dim] · [dim][/dim]after scan[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]write: teach bob capture the @<route>^<block-id> marker plus -t/--task [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and hidden --task-ref, render and insert the child bullet at the parent [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]task's own indentation, and report the new sub_bullet kind in human and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]JSON output.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob capture-tasks discovery command[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]list[dim] · [dim][/dim]after write[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]list: add the read-only bob capture-tasks subcommand that lists a note's[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]open tasks as colored human output and stable JSON for pickers, and wire[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]it into the runner, help surfaces, justfile smoke list, and README.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Hammerspoon task picker[/bold #D7AFFF]                                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ui[dim] · [dim][/dim]after list[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ui: extend the chezmoi Hammerspoon capture panel with the @<route>^<id> [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]marker family, a status-annotated task chooser backed by bob [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture-tasks, sub-bullet success notifications, and busted coverage of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the new request model.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-b","hidden":false,"llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-b.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-7d32491b74ce00594eb76549bf364082","started_at":"2026-07-31T07:56:17.305852","state":"dismissed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1785501680,"sha":"fafb07e2c23ab00e1b649840496b5aa96645d8ba","subject":"test(cli): add malformed sub-b